WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
In 2025, US workers with
a bachelor's degree had

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.810
median weekly earnings of 1,578 dollars.

3
00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.240
With a high school diploma,

4
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.360
the median was 966 dollars.

5
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.900
Then add differences in inheritance,

6
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.580
access to credit and bargaining power.

7
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.750
Those are sources of gaps too.

8
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.320
How can you sum up who
gets what in a whole

9
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.720
country with a single number?

10
00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.560
In this mission, you'll read
the curve economists use

11
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.820
to show how income is shared.

12
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:33.320
Then you'll use a graph
lab to shift income

13
00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.750
between the richest and poorest fifths,

14
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.570
and watch what happens.

15
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.680
Your mission: find out
how one number can sum

16
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.680
up who gets what in a country.
